config XCY_RECLAIM
	bool "Event-driven XiaoCaiYe memory pressure controller"
	depends on MMU && PSI && ARM64 && KERNEL_MODE_NEON && SECURITY_SELINUX
	help
	  Allow the Ace 6 controller to consume Framework PSS and application
	  protection observations from the existing Android system process.
	  It uses kernel PSI to request new observations only under pressure.
	  Without a publisher and fresh protection data it cannot send signals.
